Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.10,0:00:43.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,《夺宝奇兵2：魔域奇兵》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.47,0:03:01.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(1935年  上海)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.10,0:03:11.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,小心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be careful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.79,0:03:30.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,琼斯博士  原来你会说我的语言{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You never told me you spoke my language, Dr. Jones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.37,0:03:32.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只在特别的场合才说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only on special occasions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.92,0:03:37.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那你真的找到努尔哈赤了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, it is true? You found Nurhachi?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.01,0:03:39.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,明知故问{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know I did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.72,0:03:44.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,昨晚你的手下还想把它抢走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last night one of your boys tried to get Nurhachi without paying for him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.64,0:03:46.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你侮辱我儿子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have insulted my son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.64,0:03:48.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是你侮辱了我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you have insulted me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.89,0:03:51.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我饶了他一命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I spared his life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.19,0:03:53.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不打算作介绍？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aren't you going to introduce us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.90,0:03:59.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是威莉·丝葛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Willie Scott.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.78,0:04:03.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,印第安纳·琼斯  著名考古学家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Indiana Jones, famous archeologist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.66,0:04:09.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还以为考古学家都是四处找木奶妈的矮子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I thought archeologists were always funny little men searching for their mommies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.75,0:04:11.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是木乃伊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mummies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.25,0:04:14.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,琼斯博士替我找来努尔哈赤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Jones found Nurhachi for me,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.50,0:04:18.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而且会马上把它交出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he's going to deliver him now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.96,0:04:21.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谁是努尔哈赤？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say, who is this Nurhachi?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.30,0:04:24.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把枪收起来  小子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put the gun away, sonny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.72,0:04:30.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快还清你欠我的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I suggest you give me what you owe me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.47,0:04:32.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,否则一切告吹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or anything goes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.81,0:04:44.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,打开它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.82,0:04:52.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要钻石{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The diamond, Lao.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.20,0:04:55.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,大家有言在先{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The deal was for the diamond.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.26,0:05:20.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,阿劳!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Lao...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.10,0:05:25.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,祝你身体健康{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To your very good health.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.65,0:05:27.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,阿劳 他...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lao! He put a hole...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.69,0:05:31.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他把我的法国裙子给捅了两个洞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He put two holes in my dress from Paris!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.11,0:05:32.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,坐下!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sit down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.82,0:05:40.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在快给我努尔哈赤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, you bring me Nurhachi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.95,0:05:42.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,乐意之至{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My pleasure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.29,0:05:44.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,究竟谁是努尔哈赤？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who on Earth is this Nurhachi?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.29,0:05:50.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就在这儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.47,0:05:57.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这个努尔哈赤果真是个矮子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This Nurhachi's a real small guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.64,0:06:03.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,里面是努尔哈赤的骨灰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Inside are the remains of Nurhachi,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.60,0:06:08.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,满清的第一个皇帝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}first Emperor of Manchu Dynasty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.81,0:06:11.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎你回家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome home, old boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.45,0:06:23.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在快还我钻石{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now, you give me the diamond.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.08,0:06:26.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是故作幽默{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you trying to develop a sense of humor,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.04,0:06:28.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还是我听错了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or am I going deaf?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.34,0:06:35.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.22,0:06:37.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,解药{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Antidote.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.47,0:06:39.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,解什么的药？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.18,0:06:43.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,解你刚喝的毒酒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The poison you just drank, Dr. Jones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.98,0:06:50.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这种毒效力迅速{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The poison works fast, Dr. Jones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.91,0:07:01.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 阿劳!  - 阿劳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Lao.    - Lao!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.70,0:07:04.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我大可以另找女歌星{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You keep the girl. I find another.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.42,0:07:10.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这儿服务周到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good service here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.25,0:07:11.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他不是侍应{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not a waiter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.04,0:07:15.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,胡汉是老朋友  胜负未分…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wu Han's an old friend. Game's not over, Lao.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.01,0:07:17.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,解药{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Antidote.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.15,0:07:33.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,印第...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Indy...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.24,0:07:39.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,放心  我会救你走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry, Wu Han, I'll get you out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.11,0:07:41.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这次不行了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not this time, Indy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.53,0:07:45.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们曾多次探险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I followed you on many adventures,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.24,0:07:49.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但神秘的灵界  我要先行一步了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but into the great unknown mystery, I go first, Indy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.42,0:07:56.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别伤心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't be sad, Dr. Jones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.30,0:07:58.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你很快就能跟他共赴黄泉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will soon be joining him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.43,0:08:07.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,喝醉了  琼斯博士？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Too much to drink, Dr. Jones?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.98,0:09:00.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可恶!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, nuts!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.66,0:09:13.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 解药!   - 钻石呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The antidote.    - Where's the diamond?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.61,0:09:44.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.20,0:09:49.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你站住!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.24,0:10:32.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.12,0:10:36.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想死!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want to die!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.09,0:10:49.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.10,0:10:56.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,厉害!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow! Holy smoke!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.14,0:10:57.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,紧急着陆!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Crash landing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.06,0:11:00.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,豆钉  快开车!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Short Round, step on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.81,0:11:03.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好的  你坐稳吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okeydokey, Dr. Jones. Hold on to your potatoes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.61,0:11:06.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,司机是个小孩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For crying out loud, there's a kid driving the car!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.63,0:11:24.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哇哦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow! Wow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.05,0:11:28.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,解药呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's the antidote? Let me have it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.63,0:11:29.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们只是初次相识{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, I just met you, for Christ's sakes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.05,0:11:31.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,给我解药{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.84,0:11:33.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是随便的女孩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not that kind of girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.30,0:11:35.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士  没空缠绵了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Dr. Jones, no time for love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.77,0:11:37.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,后有追兵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got company.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.35,0:11:43.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真希望你呛死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I hope you choke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.86,0:11:49.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别开枪!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No shooting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.92,0:12:06.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是你自找麻烦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, you asked for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.36,0:12:28.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真刺激{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is fun!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.11,0:12:31.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,拿稳这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here, hold this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.24,0:12:40.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的枪呢？枪在哪？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's my gun? Where's my gun?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.37,0:12:43.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很烫手  指甲断了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I burned my fingers, and I cracked a nail!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.09,0:12:54.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士  我叫韦柏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Jones... I'm Art Weber.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.01,0:12:56.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,早跟你助手谈过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I spoke with your assistant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.72,0:12:58.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,已预留了三个位子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've managed to secure three seats,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.81,0:13:04.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可惜你们要跟家禽同舱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but there might be a slight inconvenience as you will be riding on a cargo full of live poultry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.40,0:13:05.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他在说笑吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is he kidding?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.48,0:13:07.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,时间太仓促{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Madam, it's the best I could do on such short notice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.19,0:13:11.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不是美国著名女歌星威莉吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heavens, aren't you Willie Scott, the famous American female vocalist?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.41,0:13:16.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我欠你一个人情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Owe you a gin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.46,0:13:26.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你抓不到我了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice try, Lao Che.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.01,0:13:34.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,再见  琼斯博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good-bye, Dr. Jones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.63,0:14:14.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是驯兽师吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what are you supposed to be, a lion tamer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.59,0:14:17.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我让你跟着来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm allowing you to tag along,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.47,0:14:20.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你就少开腔吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so why don't you give your mouth a rest?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.31,0:14:22.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,行吗 美女？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, doll?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.93,0:14:25.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我跟着来？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean, "tag along"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.10,0:14:26.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,每次在俱乐部{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ever since you got into my club,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.73,0:14:28.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是你一直盯着我!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you haven't been able to take your eyes off me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.94,0:14:30.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.53,0:14:49.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(中国  上海)
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.60,0:14:57.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(重庆)
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.24,0:16:07.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,糟了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.66,0:16:11.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,糟了  先生...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no! Mister, mister...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.37,0:16:13.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,先生 快醒来...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, mister, wake up. Please, mister...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.13,0:16:15.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你要叫他琼斯博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You call him Dr. Jones, doll!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.13,0:16:18.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,琼斯博士  快起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, Dr. Jones, Dr. Jones. Oh, wake up, please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.80,0:16:20.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,到达了吗？好极了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are we there already? Oh, good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.76,0:16:21.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.43,0:16:27.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 没人驾驶飞机!  - 哦 天呐...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No one's flying the plane!    - Oh, boy...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.14,0:16:30.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,机师都走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've all gone!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.40,0:16:36.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你会驾驶飞机吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know how to fly, don't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.02,0:16:38.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不会  你呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.78,0:16:39.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.99,0:16:41.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我的天呐   - 这会有多难？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, my God!    - How hard can it be?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.49,0:16:43.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我要休克了  - 测高仪  没问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm gonna faint.    - Altimeter! Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.16,0:16:46.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,空速  没问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Air speed. Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.12,0:16:47.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,燃料...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuel...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.29,0:16:51.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,燃料{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.68,0:17:07.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们有大麻烦了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we got a big problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.43,0:17:08.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 琼斯博士!   - 豆钉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dr. Jones!    - Shorty!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.02,0:17:11.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,琼斯博士  没有降落伞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Jones! No more parachutes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.39,0:17:14.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,豆钉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shorty!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.73,0:17:16.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 快来帮忙  - 那是什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on, give me a hand!    - What's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.44,0:17:17.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,推开箱子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move the box!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.82,0:17:19.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,琼斯博士  你疯了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Jones, you're crazy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.11,0:17:25.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,豆钉  拿我们的东西来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shorty, get our stuff!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.83,0:17:33.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,橡皮艇？这不是沉船{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A boat? We're not sinking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.71,0:17:35.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是撞机!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're crashing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.17,0:17:38.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,抓稳  豆钉  抓稳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grab on, Shorty! Grab on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.71,0:17:40.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 小姐  我透不过气了  - 太紧了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Lady, I can't breathe!    - Tight!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.46,0:18:21.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快减速{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Slow it down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.88,0:18:26.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这也不是太糟吧？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That wasn't so bad, was it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.27,0:18:42.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,停下来!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put on the brakes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.57,0:18:48.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我讨厌水  我讨厌弄湿身子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hate the water, and I hate being wet,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.53,0:18:51.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我还讨厌你!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I hate you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.20,0:18:53.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好极了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good. Good!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.81,0:19:20.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,琼斯博士？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Jones?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.86,0:19:22.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我没事  豆钉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm all right, Shorty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.07,0:19:24.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.45,0:19:35.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们究竟到了哪里？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are we, anyway?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.83,0:19:42.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,印度{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}India.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.08,0:19:43.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么知道？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you know that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.78,0:21:37.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真希望这代表吃晚饭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I sure hope this means dinner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.91,0:21:39.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我饿死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God, I'm starving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.41,0:21:41.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.13,0:21:50.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能吃这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't eat this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.97,0:21:55.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这些粮食比这些人所需的一周还要多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's more food than these people eat in a week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.26,0:21:56.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,时值饥荒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're starving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.97,0:21:58.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  你可以吃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I'm sorry. You can have...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.76,0:21:59.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快吃掉它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eat it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.64,0:22:04.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不饿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not hungry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.98,0:22:09.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你在侮辱他们  也让我出丑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're insulting them, and you're embarrassing me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.65,0:22:12.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 快吃  - 吃掉它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Eat it.    - Eat it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.07,0:22:14.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,吃呀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.46,0:22:30.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,该有坏消息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bad news coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.38,0:22:34.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可否派导游带我们去德里？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you provide us with a guide to take us to Delhi?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.92,0:22:37.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是个教授  我要回大学去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a professor. I have to get back to my university.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.84,0:22:40.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,沙努可作向导{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. Sajnu will guide you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.10,0:22:48.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在去德里途中  你会路经彭高{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On the way to Delhi, you will stop at Pankot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.48,0:22:51.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那才不顺路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pankot is not on the way to Delhi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.90,0:22:53.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你会去彭高皇宫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will go to Pankot Palace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.03,0:22:56.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还以为那儿已经荒废了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought the palace had been deserted since the 1850s.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.90,0:22:59.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不  那儿有一个新王公{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Now there is a new Maharajah,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.45,0:23:04.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而皇宫再次拥有邪恶的力量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and again the palace has the power of the Dark Light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.66,0:23:08.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就是它杀害我的人民{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is that place kill my people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.63,0:23:10.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What has happened here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.04,0:23:13.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,邪魔以彭高为基地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The evil start in Pankot,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.00,0:23:16.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,然后这股歪风{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then like monsoon,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.18,0:23:21.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为祸无穷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it moves darkness{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.51,0:23:26.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,令整个国家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}over all country,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.27,0:23:28.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,陷入水深火热之中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}over all country.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.73,0:23:30.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,邪魔？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The evil?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.36,0:23:34.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么邪魔？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What evil?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.69,0:23:36.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,听见了吗？坏消息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See? Bad news.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.99,0:23:39.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你听我苏华武的话  就会更长命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You listen to Suwamu. You leave Lanka.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.24,0:23:44.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,皇宫的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They came from palace{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.79,0:23:50.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,拿走了我们村的湿婆石{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and took Sivalinga from our village.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.25,0:23:52.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么石？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Took what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.88,0:23:56.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是保护这个村子的圣石{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a stone, a sacred stone from a shrine that protects the village.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.46,0:23:59.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是湿婆派你来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is why Siva brought you here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.98,0:24:10.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没人派我们来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We weren't brought here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.44,0:24:13.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们撞机后着陆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our plane crashed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.90,0:24:15.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,飞机撞毁了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It crashed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.73,0:24:16.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.74,0:24:23.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们祈求湿婆帮我们找回圣石{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We prayed to Siva to help us find the stone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.24,0:24:29.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是湿婆令你从天而降{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was Siva who made you fall from the sky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.46,0:24:39.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你要去彭高皇宫把湿婆石给我们拿回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you will go to Pankot Palace to find Sivalinga and bring back to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.47,0:24:45.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,解我们之困{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring back to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.51,0:24:51.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,琼斯博士  是他们令飞机坠毁  要你来这？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Jones, did they make the plane crash to get you here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.69,0:24:55.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不  那只是个鬼故事  放心吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Shorty, it's just a ghost story. Don't worry about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.78,0:25:01.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们在这里把圣石偷走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They took the stone from here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.78,0:25:10.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,圣石表面光滑  如圣河之石？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was the stone very smooth like a rock from a sacred river?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.95,0:25:12.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.12,0:25:14.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,石上有三条纹？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With three lines across it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.08,0:25:15.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,代表宇宙三个层面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}representing the three levels of the universe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.63,0:25:17.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 没错  - 对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's right.    - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.29,0:25:20.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我见过那种石头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've seen stones like the one you lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.55,0:25:24.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为何王公要拿走这圣石？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But why would Maharajah take the sacred stone from here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.34,0:25:28.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们要我们祭拜其邪神{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They says we must pray to their evil god.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.06,0:25:31.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不肯就范{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We says we will not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.73,0:25:36.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一块石头怎么能毁掉整条村？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me, I don't understand how one rock could destroy a whole village.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.49,0:25:43.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,圣石被偷走后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's saying when the sacred stone was taken,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.28,0:25:45.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,井干河涸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the village wells dried up, and the river turned to sand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.04,0:25:52.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,农田尽毁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The crops were swallowed by the earth,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.66,0:25:55.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,禽畜皆亡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the animals laid down and turned to dust.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.25,0:25:59.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有一晚田里着火{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then one night there was a fire in the fields.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.00,0:26:03.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,村民赶去救火{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The men went out to fight the fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.30,0:26:06.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,回来时满脸愁容{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When they came back, the women were crying in the darkness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.44,0:26:18.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,孩子们…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.98,0:26:22.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他说小孩子都被坏人掳走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He says they stole their children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.03,0:27:14.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,商羯罗…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sankara! Sankara...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.15,0:27:49.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,商羯罗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sankara.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.46,0:28:08.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那小孩从那魔宫逃出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Little boy escaped from the evil palace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.01,0:28:12.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还有无数小孩被困{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Many other children still there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.72,0:28:14.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,该怎么办？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What we do, Dr. Jones?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.98,0:28:24.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你认为呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.90,0:28:30.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有人相信这条村的幸运石{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think that somebody believes the good luck rock from this village{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.70,0:28:32.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是已失散的商羯罗石之一{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is one of the lost Sankara Stones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.82,0:28:34.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,商羯罗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is Sankara?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.99,0:28:37.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,即是财富和光荣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fortune and glory, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.50,0:28:41.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,财富和光荣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fortune and glory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.36,0:29:08.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,威莉  别再闹了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Willie, quit monkeying around on that thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.37,0:29:19.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,且慢!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, wait a second! Indy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.58,0:29:21.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能就这样去德里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't go to Delhi like this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.91,0:29:25.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不是去德里  而是去彭高{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not going to Delhi, doll. We're going to Pankot Palace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.38,0:29:27.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,彭高？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pankot?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.63,0:29:30.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能去彭高  我是个歌手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't go to Pankot! I'm a singer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.13,0:29:32.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要联络经理人  有电话打吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I need to call my agent. Is there a phone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.84,0:29:34.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我需要电话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anybody, I need a phone!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.35,0:30:28.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别再抱怨了  这可是奢侈品{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, quit complaining. This is expensive stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.11,0:30:32.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,跟我去美国  我们加入马戏团{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You come to America with me, and we get job in circus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.65,0:30:34.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吗？你喜欢美国吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You like that? You like America?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.86,0:30:38.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是我最好的朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're my best friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.12,0:30:42.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好大的鸟儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What big birds!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.95,0:30:45.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,甜心  那不是鸟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those aren't big birds, sweetheart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.41,0:30:47.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是大型吸血蝙蝠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're giant vampire bats.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.83,0:30:49.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,蝙蝠？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bats?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.76,0:31:01.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,稍安无躁  这不痛的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pipe down, you big baboon. This doesn't hurt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.76,0:31:05.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可知道你需要什么？就是洗个澡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what you really need? You really need a bath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.61,0:31:16.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真有趣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ha-ha, very funny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.70,0:31:21.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真有趣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very funny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.74,0:31:22.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,浑身湿透{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All wet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.08,0:31:26.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我本来在上海过得很开心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was happy in Shanghai.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.83,0:31:31.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有一间小屋和一个花园{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had a little house and a garden.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.34,0:31:33.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的朋友非富则贵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My friends were rich.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.46,0:31:35.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们经常去派对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We went to parties all the time in limousines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.92,0:31:38.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我讨厌在野外!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hate being outside!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.97,0:31:44.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是个歌手  这会弄坏嗓子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a singer! I could lose my voice!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.73,0:31:49.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,今晚我们在这里露营{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we'll camp here tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.90,0:31:52.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别烦我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cut it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.40,0:32:00.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 怎样？ - 两张六点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What do you got?    - Two sixes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.49,0:32:03.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,三张A  我赢了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aha-ha, three aces. I win.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.24,0:32:05.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你快要输光了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two more game, I have all your money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.04,0:32:10.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,玩扑克牌  输赢可说不准{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's poker, Shorty, anything can happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.29,0:32:13.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你在哪找来的这保镖？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where did you find your little bodyguard?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.88,0:32:16.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,抓来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't find him, I caught him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.34,0:32:17.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.63,0:32:20.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他的家人被日军杀害{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shorty's family were killed when the Japanese bombed Shanghai.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.84,0:32:22.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他从四岁就开始四处流浪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's been living on the streets since he was four.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.93,0:32:26.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,扒我钱包时被我逮着 是不是 豆钉？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I caught him trying to pick my pocket, didn't I, short stuff?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.06,0:32:32.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她最麻烦的就是那声音{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Biggest trouble with her is the noise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.24,0:32:43.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你出千  你出老千{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! You cheat, Dr. Jones. You cheat!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.41,0:32:44.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 什么意思？ - 你拿了四张牌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What do you mean?    - You take four card.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.49,0:32:48.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 快付钱  - 它们粘在一起了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You pay now.    - Oh, they were stuck together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.91,0:32:50.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 没有粘在一起  - 它们就是粘在一起了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No stuck. No mistake.    - They were stuck together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.29,0:32:51.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一时错手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a mistake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.41,0:32:53.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别出千欺负小孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm very little. You cheat very big.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.75,0:32:56.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士  你出千{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Jones, you cheat!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.63,0:32:58.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你欠我一毛钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You pay money. You owe me ten cent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.30,0:33:01.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看这个  看这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at this. Look at this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.93,0:33:06.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你还敢说我出千？是你出千{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You accuse me of cheating. You're cheating.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.85,0:33:14.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你要我输钱  没意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You make me poor. No fun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.27,0:33:16.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,跟你玩真没意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Play with you no fun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.94,0:33:19.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不玩了  - 我也不玩了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I quit.    - I quit, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.03,0:33:21.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这地方完全被包围了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This place is completely surrounded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.03,0:33:24.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,到处都是野生动物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The entire place is crawling with living things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.36,0:33:26.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是森林{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why they call it the jungle, sweetheart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.78,0:33:28.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还会有什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God, what else is out there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.37,0:33:29.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,威莉…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Willie, wait...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.13,0:33:36.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,威莉…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Willie, Willie...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.96,0:33:39.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是一个简称吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is that? Is that short for something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.13,0:33:43.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是我的艺名  印第安纳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Willie" is my professional name, Indiana.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.93,0:33:46.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,小姐  你要叫他琼斯博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, lady, you call him Dr. Jones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.80,0:33:48.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的艺名{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My professional name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.60,0:33:53.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为何要去这魔宫？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you dragging us off to this deserted palace?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.14,0:33:54.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,财富和光荣？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fortune and glory?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.85,0:33:56.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,财富和光荣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fortune and glory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.31,0:33:59.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,呃...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.03,0:34:02.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这源自古代的手稿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this is a piece of an old manuscript.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.32,0:34:06.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在这幅壁画里的是祭司商羯罗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This pictograph represents Sankara, a priest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.16,0:34:07.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,走开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scram.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.41,0:34:11.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,小心点  这个有几百年的历史{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gentle. Gentle. This is hundreds of years old.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.29,0:34:12.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是文字？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that some kind of writing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.75,0:34:14.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对  是梵文{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, it's Sanskrit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.41,0:34:15.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别闹了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cut it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.50,0:34:17.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,源自商羯罗传说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's part of the legend of Sankara.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.34,0:34:21.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他攀登凯拉萨山拜见印度神湿婆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He climbs Mount Kalisa where he meets Siva, the Hindu god.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.96,0:34:25.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是湿婆？他给祭司的是什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's Siva? And what's he handing the priest?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.63,0:34:27.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 圣石  - 停{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Rocks.    - Stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.39,0:34:30.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他吩咐他去对抗邪魔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He told him to go forth and combat evil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.97,0:34:35.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,给他五块有法力的魔石{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And to help him, he gave him five sacred stones with magical properties.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.27,0:34:36.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,魔石？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Magic rocks?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.85,0:34:38.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我爷爷是魔术师{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My grandpa was a magician.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.36,0:34:41.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他终生都在做帽子藏兔子 袖子藏鸽子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He spent his entire life with a rabbit in his pocket and pigeons up his sleeves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.82,0:34:45.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他让不少小孩开怀大笑  自己却潦倒终老{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He made a lot of children happy and died a very poor man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.24,0:34:48.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,魔石  财富和光荣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Magic rocks. Fortune and glory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.37,0:34:50.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,做个好梦吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sweet dreams, Dr. Jones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.03,0:34:52.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你上哪儿去？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.99,0:34:55.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你该靠近我睡觉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd sleep closer, if I were you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.21,0:34:57.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为了安全起见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For safety's sake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.25,0:35:01.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那我与蛇共枕更安全{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Jones, I'd be safer sleeping with a snake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.51,0:35:05.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我叫你别再瞎闹了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said, cut it out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.18,0:35:11.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这大象真讨厌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hate that elephant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.46,0:35:42.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,印第  你看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Indy, look!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.46,0:35:47.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我看见了  那就是彭高皇宫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see it, Shorty. That's it. Pankot Palace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.46,0:37:07.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士  你在看什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Jones, what you look at?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.63,0:37:10.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't come up here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.01,0:37:18.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不不不 不要走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! No, no, no, no! Don't leave! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.68,0:37:21.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不不不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no, no, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.68,0:37:23.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,乖大象 呆在这{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, baby elephant, stay here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.52,0:37:25.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 印第{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no! Indy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.69,0:37:27.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们带走了大象{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're stealing our rides!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.36,0:37:30.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们从这里开始步行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We walk from here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.81,0:38:07.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.36,0:38:10.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看来你们迷路了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should say you look rather lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.90,0:38:14.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但在这世上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But then I cannot imagine where in the world{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.11,0:38:16.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们视何处为家？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the three of you would look at home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.24,0:38:18.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们没迷路  我们在去德里的路上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not lost. We're on our way to Delhi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.08,0:38:20.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是丝葛小姐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Miss Scott.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.04,0:38:22.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是豆钉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Mr. Round.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.95,0:38:24.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,小豆钉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Short Round.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.25,0:38:26.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我叫印第安纳·琼斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name is Indiana Jones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.75,0:38:29.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,琼斯博士  著名的考古学家？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Jones, the eminent archeologist?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.71,0:38:31.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,难以相信吧？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hard to believe, isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.42,0:38:36.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我在牛津初闻你的大名{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I remember first hearing your name when I was up at Oxford.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.68,0:38:41.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是查达·拉尔  彭高王公的首相{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Chattar Lal, Prime Minister to His Highness, the Maharajah of Pankot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.18,0:38:43.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,幸会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm enchanted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.77,0:38:46.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,幸会  非常感谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enchanted. Thank you very much. Thank you very much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.60,0:38:48.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎来到彭高皇宫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to Pankot Palace!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.11,0:38:53.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,幸会？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enchanted, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.21,0:39:07.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,豆钉  我的剃刀呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shorty, where's my razor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.23,0:39:36.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴今晚来了多位稀客{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are fortunate tonight to have so many unexpected visitors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.95,0:39:38.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是上尉…庞拔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Captain... ...Blumburtt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.78,0:39:40.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,浦那步枪队{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}11th Poona Rifles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.32,0:39:43.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你该是琼斯博士了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you, sir, are Dr. Jones, I presume.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.66,0:39:44.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am, Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.87,0:39:48.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,上尉的部队来作例行检查{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain Blumburtt and his troops are on a routine inspection tour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.00,0:39:52.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,英军喜欢随时来监察{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The British find it amusing to inspect us at their convenience.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.63,0:39:57.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,倒希望没给你带来不便  首相{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do hope, sir, that it's not inconvenient to you, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.01,0:40:00.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,英国很关心其帝国{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The British worry so about their empire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.84,0:40:03.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让我们觉得是受宠爱的孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Makes us all feel like well-cared-for children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.19,0:40:16.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你明艳照人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.15,0:40:19.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,王公财雄势大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think the Maharajah is swimming in loot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.49,0:40:23.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也许来这儿也不是那么糟糕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe it wasn't such a bad idea coming here after all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.41,0:40:25.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你活像一个皇妃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look like a princess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.74,0:40:29.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,拉尔先生  王公的老婆叫什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Lal, what do they call the Maharajah's wife?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.79,0:40:32.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,陛下还没成亲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His Highness has not yet taken a wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.46,0:40:33.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有趣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How interesting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.63,0:40:37.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也许他还没找到意中人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, maybe it's because he hasn't found the right woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.52,0:40:52.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有请陛下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His Supreme Highness,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.60,0:40:56.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,彭高传统的守护者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}guardian of Pankot tradition,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.69,0:40:59.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,彭高王公{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the Maharajah of Pankot,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.99,0:41:03.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,沙林·辛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zalim Singh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.89,0:41:26.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他就是王公？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the Maharajah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.22,0:41:28.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一个小孩？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A kid?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.06,0:41:33.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也许他喜欢老女人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe he like older women.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.20,0:41:43.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,庞拔上尉告诉了我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain Blumburtt was just telling me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.91,0:41:46.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,皇宫的历史{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}something of the interesting history of the palace,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.45,0:41:49.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还有它在叛乱时期的重要性{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the importance it played in the mutiny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.16,0:41:53.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看来英国无法忘记1857年的叛乱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It seems the British never forget the Mutiny of 1857.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.79,0:41:56.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我认为叛乱前的一些事件…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, well, you know, I think there are other events,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.96,0:41:59.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,再往前一百多年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before the mutiny, going back a century,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.25,0:42:02.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,克莱夫时代更有趣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}back to the time of Clive, that are more interesting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.30,0:42:04.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哪些事件？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what events are those, Dr. Jones?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.63,0:42:07.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,若我没记错  这个地区{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, if memory serves me correctly, this area, this province,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.97,0:42:10.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,曾盛行邪教{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was the center of activity for the Thuggee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.23,0:42:16.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是大蛇宝盆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Snake... Surprise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.44,0:42:18.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有什么宝？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the surprise?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.57,0:42:30.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,琼斯博士 你真是见多识广{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Jones, you know perfectly well{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.66,0:42:33.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,邪教的歪风已灭绝近百年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the Thuggee cult has been dead for nearly a century.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.25,0:42:34.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.16,0:42:37.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那些坏蛋祭拜卡莉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Thuggee was an obscenity{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.67,0:42:40.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,以人祭神{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that worshipped Kali with human sacrifices.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.42,0:42:43.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,英军已把他们铲除{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The British Army nicely did away with them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.84,0:42:50.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我看邪教的故事难以失传{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I suppose stories of the Thuggee die hard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.26,0:42:52.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没有这种事发生了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are no stories anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.27,0:42:54.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这个说不准{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not so sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.52,0:42:57.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们从小村落来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We came from a small village.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.69,0:43:03.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,农民说彭高因有邪魔之力而大盛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The peasants there told us Pankot Palace was growing powerful again because of some ancient evil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.03,0:43:09.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那都是骇人听闻的民间传说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Village stories, Dr. Jones. They're just fear and folklore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.49,0:43:13.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你令庞拔上尉担心起来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're beginning to worry Captain Blumburtt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.74,0:43:19.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没这回事  我只是觉得有趣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not worried, Mr. Prime Minister, just interested.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.14,0:43:38.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不吃东西？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? You are not eating?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.94,0:43:41.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,午餐吃过甲虫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had bugs for lunch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.90,0:43:47.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,给我帽子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me your hat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.57,0:43:49.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.99,0:43:52.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我想吐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Cause I'm gonna puke in it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.29,0:43:58.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,村民说彭高的人拿走了一些东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, the villagers also told us Pankot Palace had taken something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.75,0:44:01.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在本国{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Jones, in our country,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.54,0:44:04.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很少有宾客侮辱主人家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's not usual for a guest to insult his host.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.84,0:44:07.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.09,0:44:10.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还以为我们在谈民间传说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought we were talking about folklore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.55,0:44:14.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,请问有没有简单点的？例如汤？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me, sir, do you have anything simple, like soup?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.85,0:44:19.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们到底有什么东西被拿走了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What exactly was it they say was stolen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.19,0:44:21.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一块圣石{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A sacred rock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.69,0:44:27.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你听见了  上尉  一块石头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see, Captain, a rock!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.29,0:44:49.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那块圣石跟商羯罗传说有关{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something connected the villagers' rock and the old legend of the Sankara Stones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.38,0:44:54.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,大家都明白人言可畏的道理{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Jones, we are all vulnerable to vicious rumors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.05,0:44:58.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我记得洪都拉斯曾指你是盗墓者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I seem to remember that in Honduras you were accused of being a grave robber{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.52,0:45:00.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而不是考古学家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}rather than an archeologist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.31,0:45:03.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,报章把事情夸张渲染了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, the newspapers greatly exaggerated the incident.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.73,0:45:06.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马达加斯加国王不是说你若再踏入他们的国土{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And wasn't it the Sultan of Madagascar who threatened to cut your head off{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.07,0:45:08.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他要斩你的头吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you ever returned to his country?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.48,0:45:09.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不是斩头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it wasn't my head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.61,0:45:10.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是斩手吧？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then your hands, perhaps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.99,0:45:12.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也不是斩手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it wasn't my hands,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.07,0:45:14.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是我…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it was my...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.53,0:45:16.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是一场误会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My misunderstanding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.91,0:45:19.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在正是如此{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Exactly what we have here, Dr. Jones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.29,0:45:23.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我对邪教的恶行有所闻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have heard the evil stories of the Thuggee cult.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.42,0:45:26.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我还以为那只是吓唬小孩之说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought the stories were told to frighten children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.13,0:45:30.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,后来我发现曾经真有其事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Later, I learnt the Thuggee cult was once real{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.34,0:45:32.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们作恶多端{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and did of unspeakable things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.18,0:45:36.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我以这一段历史为耻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am ashamed of what happened here so many years ago,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.85,0:45:38.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也向你保证{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I assure you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.26,0:45:42.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,本国不会再有此歪风{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this will never happen again in my kingdom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.19,0:45:45.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我出言冒犯了陛下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I offended you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.36,0:45:47.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那对不起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then I am sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.83,0:46:00.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,甜品{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dessert!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.38,0:46:15.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,冰冻猴子脑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chilled monkey brains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.15,0:46:33.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我先去看看威莉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I'll just check on Willie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.70,0:46:36.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你该这么做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's all you better do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.78,0:46:40.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,然后告诉我情况{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me later what happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.99,0:46:42.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别多事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Am-scray.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.59,0:46:55.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我拿了一些东西给你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got something for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.76,0:46:59.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你绝不会有东西是我想要的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's nothing you have that I could possibly want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.68,0:47:01.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.07,0:47:15.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你真是一个好人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a very nice man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.07,0:47:19.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也许可做我的爱奴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe you could be my palace slave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.62,0:47:31.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,戴着珠宝颈链睡觉？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wear your jewels to bed, Princess?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.79,0:47:33.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.05,0:47:36.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还只穿了睡袍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And nothing else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.13,0:47:38.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,觉得意外吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That shock you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.38,0:47:40.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不会大惊小怪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing shocks me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.80,0:47:42.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是个科学家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a scientist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.89,0:47:47.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那你做了不少研究？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, as a scientist, you do a lot of research?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.73,0:47:49.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,经常做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Always.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.35,0:47:51.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你会拿我作什么研究？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what sort of research would you do on me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.28,0:47:56.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,夜间活动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nocturnal activities.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.74,0:47:59.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我搽哪种面霜？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean like what sort of cream I put on my face at night,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.86,0:48:01.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的睡姿？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what position I like to sleep in?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.74,0:48:03.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,交欢的习惯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mating customs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.16,0:48:04.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,做爱的方式？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Love rituals?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.49,0:48:07.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,原始的性趣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Primitive sexual practices.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.29,0:48:09.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在这一领域  你是权威吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you're an authority in that area?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.33,0:48:10.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,多年研习{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Years of fieldwork.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.38,0:48:22.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不怪你气我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't blame you for being sore at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.18,0:48:25.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我挺难缠的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can be hard to handle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.52,0:48:28.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我遇过更糟的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've had worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.93,0:48:31.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但我是最好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you'll never have better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.11,0:48:35.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.90,0:48:38.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,做实验不能先入为主{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As a scientist, I don't want to prejudice my experiment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.24,0:48:39.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,明早再说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll let you know in the morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.99,0:48:43.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你这个自大鬼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why, you conceited ape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.66,0:48:45.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我可没那么随便{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not that easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.58,0:48:49.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我也不是那么随便的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not that easy, either.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.21,0:48:51.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的麻烦是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trouble with you is, Willie,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.83,0:48:54.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你太习惯人家顺从你的做法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're too used to getting your own way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.88,0:48:56.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你太自负{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you're just too proud to admit{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.21,0:48:59.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不肯承认为我着迷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that you're crazy about me, Dr. Jones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.88,0:49:02.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,若你要找我  你知道我在哪里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you want me, Willie, you know where you can find me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.51,0:49:04.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,五分钟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.05,0:49:07.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你一定会在五分钟内回头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll be back over here in five minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.14,0:49:08.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那时我已睡着了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be asleep in five minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.77,0:49:09.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,五{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.06,0:49:12.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这自有分晓{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know it, and I know it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.08,0:49:29.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,五分钟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.25,0:49:33.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,四分半钟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Four and a half.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.05,0:50:29.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"爱奴"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Palace slave."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.68,0:50:31.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"夜间活动"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Nocturnal activities."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.60,0:50:35.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是个"自大鬼"？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a "conceited ape"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.23,0:50:37.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"明早再说"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"I'll tell you in the morning."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.52,0:50:41.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,难以置信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't believe it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.57,0:50:42.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他不会来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.28,0:50:44.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她不会来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's not coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.24,0:50:48.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,难以相信我不过去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't believe I'm not going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.97,0:51:10.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,印第安纳·琼斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Indiana Jones!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.60,0:51:13.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这一晚你会毕生难忘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is one night you'll never forget!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.35,0:51:16.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为这一晚你错失了大好良机{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the night I slipped right through your fingers!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.56,0:51:19.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,祝你睡得安好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sleep tight,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.90,0:51:21.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,做个美梦!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and pleasant dreams!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.53,0:51:27.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我本来可以是你最大的寻宝收获{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could have been your greatest adventure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.75,0:51:38.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士  你的皮鞭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Jones, your whip!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.40,0:52:01.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,豆钉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shorty,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.56,0:52:02.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,关掉风扇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}turn off the switch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.20,0:52:10.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,印第{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Indy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.70,0:52:14.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对我温柔一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be gentle with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.37,0:52:22.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I'm here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.05,0:52:35.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没人在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's nobody here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.43,0:52:37.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不  我在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I'm here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.43,0:52:41.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,印第  你古古怪怪的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Indy, you're acting awfully strange.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.13,0:53:10.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我就在你的面前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, I'm right here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.19,0:53:26.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"跟随湿婆的足迹"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Follow in the footsteps of Siva."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.65,0:53:28.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What does that mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.57,0:53:34.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"别背叛他的真理"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Do not betray these truths."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.91,0:53:37.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,豆钉  去拿工具来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shorty, go get our stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.52,0:54:08.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,豆钉  留在我背后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay behind me, Short Round.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.65,0:54:14.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,跟着我走  别碰任何东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Step where I step, and don't touch anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.79,0:54:27.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我跟随你的脚步{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I step where you step.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.33,0:54:29.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不碰任何东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I touch nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.55,0:54:32.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,印第!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Indy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.19,0:54:54.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我踩住了一些东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I step on something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.16,0:54:58.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我也感觉到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, there's something on the ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.49,0:55:00.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,地上好像铺满了签饼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Feel like step on fortune cookies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.04,0:55:04.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那不是签饼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not fortune cookies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.29,0:55:08.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让我看看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me take a look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.81,0:55:23.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不是签饼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's no cookies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.14,0:55:25.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  我弄走它了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all right. I got him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.27,0:55:31.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快跟我来!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go. There, go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.19,0:56:12.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,停步{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.36,0:56:15.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你靠着墙站  好吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, just stand up against the wall, will you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.58,0:56:32.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是你叫我靠着墙站的!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You say to stand against the wall!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.83,0:56:34.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我照你说的做了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I listen to what you say!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.25,0:56:36.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不是我的错   - 威莉  快下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Not my fault! Not my fault!    - Willie, get down here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.42,0:56:38.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们有麻烦了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're in trouble!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.55,0:56:41.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,威莉!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Willie! Willie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.34,0:56:43.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,又要弄得一身脏了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bet I get all dirty again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.39,0:56:45.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 威莉  快下来   - 不是我的错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Willie, get down here!    - Not my fault!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.01,0:56:47.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们有麻烦了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're in trouble!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.60,0:56:50.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,麻烦？什么麻烦…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trouble? Trouble? What sort of...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.91,0:57:07.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不是闹着玩的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is serious!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.70,0:57:11.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这儿有两条尸体{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are two dead people down here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.25,0:57:14.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这儿也快要有两条尸体了  快来!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There're going to be two dead people in here! Hurry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.54,0:57:16.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我受够你们了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've almost had enough of you two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.88,0:57:17.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,威莉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Willie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.05,0:57:19.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,急什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the rush?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.92,0:57:23.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快点  我们就快没命了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a long story, Willie. Hurry, or you don't get to hear it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.10,0:57:27.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,老天  这是什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God, what is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.73,0:57:31.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,印第  这是什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Indy, what is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.44,0:57:33.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这儿漆黑一片{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't see a thing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.56,0:57:35.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,赶快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.73,0:57:37.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.73,0:57:38.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,指甲弄断了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I broke a nail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.46,0:57:55.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,威莉  赶快!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Willie, hurry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.08,0:57:57.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它们在我头上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're in my hair!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.17,0:57:58.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴  威莉!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up, Willie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.21,0:58:02.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 让我进来  - 不  让我们出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Indy, let me in!    - No, let us out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.80,0:58:04.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 让我进来  - 让我们出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let me in!    - Let us out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.93,0:58:06.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 闭嘴!  - 我下来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Shut up!    - I'm down here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.72,0:58:08.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我满身都是虫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're all over me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.85,0:58:11.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一定有机关{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's got to be a fulcrum release lever somewhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.60,0:58:12.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.77,0:58:14.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,开门的机关{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A handle that opens the door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.81,0:58:16.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 快找  - 不  只有方洞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Go on!    - They're just, just square holes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.61,0:58:18.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,去右边的洞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go to the right hole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.44,0:58:20.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,赶快!  威莉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry, Willie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.78,0:58:30.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,另一个  你右边那个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The other one! The other right. Your other right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.87,0:58:33.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你右边那个  - 里面湿漉漉的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The one on your right!    - There's slime inside!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.87,0:58:35.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我做不到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.58,0:58:37.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你能做得到  伸手进去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can do it. Feel inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.67,0:58:38.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.30,0:58:43.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你伸手摸摸看!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You feel inside!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.13,0:58:45.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快点!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do it now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.51,0:58:46.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.06,0:59:00.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,威莉  我们快要死了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Willie, we are going to die!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.98,0:59:03.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,软软的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's soft.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.32,0:59:07.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它在动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's moving!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.75,0:59:16.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,找到了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.51,0:59:33.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快帮我拍走身上的虫!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get 'em off of me! Get 'em off of me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.64,0:59:36.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快帮我拍走身上的虫!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're all over me! Get 'em off me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.02,0:59:40.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.44,0:59:44.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不是我  是她!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It wasn't me! It's her!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.28,0:59:47.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快点!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.53,0:59:50.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快来!  快点!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go! Move! Come on, move! Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.59,1:00:53.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是邪教仪式{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a Thuggee ceremony.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.76,1:00:55.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们在祭拜卡莉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're worshipping Kali.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.81,1:01:07.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你见过这个吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you ever seen anything like this before?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.57,1:01:09.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,百年来没人见过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody's seen this for a hundred years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.87,1:02:49.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,卡莉神  卡莉神{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kali Ma. Kali Ma...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.50,1:02:51.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,卡莉神{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kali Ma!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.88,1:03:30.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他还没死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's still alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.15,1:06:01.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是村民的圣石{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the rock they took from the village.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.40,1:06:03.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,商羯罗石之一{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's one of the Sankara Stones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.16,1:06:13.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它们怎么会发亮？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why they glow like that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.12,1:06:16.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,传说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The legend says{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.79,1:06:18.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当圣石汇聚在一起时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when the rocks are brought together,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.13,1:06:20.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,里面的钻石会发光{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the diamonds inside them will glow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.17,1:06:22.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,钻石？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Diamonds?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.30,1:06:23.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,钻石{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Diamonds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.47,1:06:24.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,钻石{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Diamonds!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.76,1:06:25.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,钻石{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Diamonds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.28,1:06:48.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们安静地留在这…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I want you two to stay up here and keep quiet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.12,1:06:49.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,豆钉  你盯着她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shorty, you keep an eye on her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.53,1:06:51.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你要去哪里？  - 下面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why, where are you going?    - Down there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.33,1:06:54.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,下面？你疯了吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Down there? Are you crazy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.46,1:06:57.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要拿回圣石{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not leaving here without the stones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.67,1:07:00.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你会为追求财富和光荣而死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You could get killed chasing after your damn fortune and glory!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.96,1:07:01.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也许{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.55,1:07:05.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但今天不会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But not today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.67,1:08:22.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,小心点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be careful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.28,1:09:34.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他要去哪里？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's he going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.53,1:09:38.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,放开我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.62,1:09:44.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,威莉  快跑!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run, Willie! Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.89,1:11:19.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,琼斯博士!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Jones!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.76,1:11:23.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,早告诉你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I keep telling you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.22,1:11:26.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,听我的话  你就会更长命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you listen me more, you live longer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.39,1:11:28.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,求你让我死掉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, let me die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.52,1:11:31.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我祈求湿婆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I pray to Siva,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.36,1:11:35.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"让我死掉" 但死不了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Let me die," but I do not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.07,1:11:38.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在卡莉的邪力占据了我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now... Now the evil of Kali take me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.62,1:11:41.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.87,1:11:44.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我会被迫喝卡莉的血{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They will make me drink the blood of the Kali.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.75,1:11:48.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,接着我就会受邪魔操控{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I'll fall into the Black Sleep of the Kali Ma.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.37,1:11:49.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那会怎样？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.63,1:11:51.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就像他们那样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We become like them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.51,1:11:58.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们虽生犹死  是活死人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll be alive, but like a nightmare.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.38,1:12:01.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你喝了魔血就会如行尸走肉一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You drink blood, you not wake up from nightmare.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.73,1:12:17.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你偷商羯罗石时被逮个正着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were caught trying to steal the Sankara Stones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.45,1:12:20.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,本来有五颗圣石{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There were five stones in the beginning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.62,1:12:24.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,几百年来  圣石因战乱散失{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over the centuries, they were dispersed by wars,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.62,1:12:26.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,或被你这种盗贼偷走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}sold off by thieves like you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.83,1:12:28.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我这种盗贼？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thieves like me, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.12,1:12:32.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你还欠两块圣石{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Still missing two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.21,1:12:37.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一百年前  英军血洗这间庙宇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A century ago, when the British raided this temple and butchered my people,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.51,1:12:41.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,祭司把那两块圣石藏在地下墓穴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a loyal priest hid the last two stones down here in the catacombs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.97,1:12:45.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所以你要那批奴隶替你掘墓？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So that's what you've got these slaves digging for, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.72,1:12:47.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们只是无辜的小孩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're innocent children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.14,1:12:49.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们采宝石来资助我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They dig for the gems to support our cause.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.35,1:12:54.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们也在寻找那两块圣石{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They also search for the last two stones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.48,1:13:00.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不久我们就会集齐五块圣石{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Soon we will have all the five Sankara Stones,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.15,1:13:03.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们这帮人就能大权在握{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the Thuggees will be all powerful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.57,1:13:06.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的想像力真丰富{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a vivid imagination.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.33,1:13:14.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不相信我？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't believe me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.80,1:13:18.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你会相信的  博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will, Dr. Jones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.34,1:13:24.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你会成为其中一个虔诚的信徒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will become a true believer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.20,1:13:43.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.06,1:14:09.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,琼斯博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Jones!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.39,1:14:10.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别喝魔血{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't drink, it's bad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.93,1:14:12.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别喝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't drink!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.02,1:14:14.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快把它吐出来!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spit it out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.35,1:14:50.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,琼斯博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Jones...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.95,1:15:11.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你别胡来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You dare not do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.93,1:15:31.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别打他  混蛋!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave him alone, you bastards!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.53,1:15:44.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,英军会被歼灭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The British in India will be slaughtered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.82,1:15:47.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们控制穆斯林{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then we will overrun the Muslims.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.15,1:15:49.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,然后犹太人的神会没落{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then the Hebrew God will fall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.70,1:15:53.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,基督教的神也会随之被摒弃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then the Christian God will be cast down and forgotten.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.16,1:15:59.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不久卡莉神就会统治世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Soon, Kali Ma will rule the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.71,1:16:07.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,琼斯博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Jones...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.07,1:17:53.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,卡莉神保佑我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kali Ma protects us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.03,1:17:56.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们是她的孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are her children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.41,1:17:59.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们以人祭神{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We pledge our devotion to her{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.62,1:18:01.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,以显虔诚之心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with an offering of flesh...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.62,1:18:03.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.29,1:18:08.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还奉上鲜血{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.47,1:18:21.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的朋友对这一切已耳闻目睹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your friend has seen, and she has heard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.94,1:18:25.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在她要保守秘密{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now she will not talk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.16,1:18:38.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我对这个地方毫无好印象{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not going to have anything nice to say about this place when I get back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.20,1:18:42.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,印第!  快救我!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Indy! For God sakes, help me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.66,1:18:44.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the matter with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.01,1:19:02.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.71,1:19:39.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.87,1:20:03.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,印第安纳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Indiana...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.25,1:20:08.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,印第安纳  救我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Indiana, help us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.39,1:20:24.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,求求你快醒过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, snap out of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.93,1:20:32.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不是他们的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not one of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.73,1:20:37.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,求你醒过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please come back to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.61,1:20:40.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别舍我而去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't leave me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.63,1:20:56.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.92,1:21:01.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你在做什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.22,1:21:02.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你疯了吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you mad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.59,1:22:22.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这不会是真的  这不会是真的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This can't be happening, this can't be happening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.84,1:22:25.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,威莉  醒醒吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wake up, Willie, wake up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.04,1:22:59.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 不 不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! No! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.93,1:23:13.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 不 不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.56,1:23:16.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士  快醒来!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wake up, Dr. Jones, wake up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.11,1:23:22.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,琼斯博士!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Jones!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.46,1:23:40.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,印第  我爱你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Indy, I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.38,1:23:44.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快醒来  印第!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wake up, Indy! Wake up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.13,1:23:49.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是我最好的朋友  快醒来!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're my best friend! Wake up, Indy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.52,1:23:56.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait! Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.31,1:23:58.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他是我的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's mine!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.40,1:24:04.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我没事了  小子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm all right, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.20,1:24:50.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,莫拉林!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mola Ram!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.45,1:26:14.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,帮我一把{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me some slack!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.43,1:26:36.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,威莉  快醒来!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Willie, Willie, wake up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.18,1:26:40.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,威莉  是我  我醒过来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Willie, Willie, it's me! I'm back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.44,1:26:45.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,印第{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Indy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.13,1:27:15.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,印第  我的朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Indy, my friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.38,1:27:18.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  小子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.06,1:27:28.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们快离开这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Indy, now, let's get out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.77,1:27:33.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对  所有人离开这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right. All of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.73,1:28:48.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不行!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.83,1:29:05.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要去救他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got to save him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.04,1:29:08.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他会照顾自己  - 他需要我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He can take care of himself.    - He needs me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.00,1:29:12.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要去救印第!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got to save Indy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.55,1:29:26.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  去救他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, save him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.64,1:29:32.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把他放下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drop him down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.15,1:29:34.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,否则我宰了你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I kill you! Drop him down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.64,1:30:07.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他怎么搞的？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the matter with him?{\r}
