Dialogue: 0,1:48:11.81,1:48:13.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你背叛了湿婆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You betrayed Siva.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:22.78,1:48:24.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你背叛了湿婆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You betrayed Siva!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:56.31,1:48:58.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也是时候了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it's about time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:16.50,1:49:18.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,停火!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold your fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:20.58,1:51:22.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当村里恢复生气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We know you are coming back{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:23.12,1:51:25.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们就知道你们会平安归来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when life return to our village.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:29.96,1:51:36.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在你该明白圣石的威力了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you can see the magic of the rock you bring back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:36.76,1:51:40.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对  我明白了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I understand its power now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:46.31,1:51:47.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你本来可以保留圣石{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You could've kept it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:47.90,1:51:49.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,做什么？还不是放在博物馆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What for? They'd just put it in a museum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:49.90,1:51:52.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等着铺满尘埃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'd be another rock collecting dust.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:52.40,1:51:55.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它本可以为你带来财富和光荣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But then it would've given you your fortune and glory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:56.03,1:51:57.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,世事难料{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything could happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:57.86,1:52:00.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,去德里路途遥远{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a long way to Delhi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:00.16,1:52:01.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不  谢了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:01.33,1:52:03.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不要再跟你冒险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No more adventures with you, Dr. Jones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:03.66,1:52:07.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们这旅程不是充满乐趣吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sweetheart, after all the fun we've had together?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:08.38,1:52:11.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,若你以为你让我吃了这么多苦头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you think I'm going to Delhi with you, or anyplace else{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:11.50,1:52:13.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我还会跟你上路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}after all the trouble you've gotten me into,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:13.59,1:52:15.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你可真会做梦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}think again, buster!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:15.38,1:52:17.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我这就回家去 不用吃蛇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going home to Missouri where they never feed you snakes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:17.88,1:52:20.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也不用被挖心肝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before ripping your heart out and lowering you into hot pits!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:20.68,1:52:24.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这对我而言  绝不是乐趣!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is not my idea of a swell time!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:24.27,1:52:27.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,先生  我要找向导带我去德里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me, sir. I need a guide to Delhi. If you could...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:47.04,1:52:48.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真有趣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very funny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:54.00,1:52:56.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真有趣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very funny.{\r}
